t bottom)) (uuid "c142ebd7-6dd5-5218-aa72-a934abd67c09")) (wire (pts (xy 58.42 228.6) (xy 63.5 228.6)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "6eef598b-dde2-5178-a28f-e94866ff7076")) (label "GND" (at 63.5 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0b5e0d67-9993-5bd0-a77e-e43f4b1b3a2c")) (text "SOURCE: TI SNVSBD5D Fig 9-1, Tables 9-2/3; SNVU621D Fig 4-1 (Q1 EVM).\nFUNCTION: VIN_PROTECTED -> 5.1 V nominal / 5 A. No 6 A peak rating.\nMODIFICATION: 6.8 uH; 100k/24.4k FB; 50 V raw-rail caps; BIAS grounded; input PGOOD gates EN.\nRATIONALE: input margin, ripple/tolerance headroom and buck-fault exposure. VCC is internal use only.\nCRITICAL LOOP: C203 VIN1-PGND1 and C204 VIN2-PGND2 immediately at U201; join both PGND to AGND.\nFeedback stays before disconnect. Keep SW away from FB and Kelvin routes. No physical layout exists.\nOPEN: exact RJR footprint, guaranteed effective L/C, load transient and thermal validation. See BUCK_DESIGN.md." (at 15.24 241.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bd370b10-3163-5859-b2c9-311a858cc12a")) )
